    "source": {
      "value": "gw2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This small crystal vial contains the forked end of a demon's tongue, preserved in brine. The spell attack roll of any spell cast by Activating this item is +7, and the spell DC is 17.\n\n- **Armor** You gain resistance 2 to acid and attacks by demons.\n- **Weapon** After you cast an acid spell by Activating the pickled demon tongue, your Strikes with the weapon deal an additional 1d4 acid damage until end of your next turn.\n\nYou cast acid splash."
    },
